    "shared_held": "80C33394 / PS_80C37280: same periodic UV-ramp motif, cb0[0]/[1] grey inspection values; Frame26 dissolve. GenerateGbuffer0 retained; ShadowGenerate2/ComputeSkinning4 omitted.",
